<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>Your Claude Code — token ROI</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #F4F3F0;
    --card: #FFFFFF;
    --ink: #070E08;
    --ink-soft: #1F2E24;
    --text-2: #4A554F;
    --muted: #7A8581;
    --rule: rgba(7, 14, 8, 0.12);
    --accent: #3F784E;
    --accent-soft: #93F099;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }
  header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); }
  .summary { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-2); max-width: 70ch; }
  .stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .stat {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    min-width: 130px;
  }
  .stat .v { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .stat .l { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-top: 2px; }
  section.chart {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 26px 26px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  section.chart h2 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  section.chart .explainer { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-2); margin: 6px 0 18px; max-width: 78ch; }
  .svg-holder { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
  .svg-holder svg { display: block; }
  footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  footer .privacy { font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
  footer .caveat { margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <span class="eyebrow">Bigspin · token-roi</span>
    <h1>Your Claude Code — token ROI</h1>
    <p class="summary">{{ summary_line }}</p>
    <div class="stats">
      {% for s in stat_cards %}
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="v">{{ s.value }}</div>
        <div class="l">{{ s.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="chart">
    <h2>Weekly trend</h2>
    <p class="explainer">Each line is the weekly median per session, indexed to your first two confident weeks (= 1.0×) on a log scale — so you can see whether output tokens, activity, and engineering outcomes are moving together or apart. Pink weeks had too few sessions to trust.</p>
    <div class="svg-holder">{{ trend_svg | safe }}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="chart">
    <h2>Weekly outcome distributions</h2>
    <p class="explainer">For each outcome, the share of sessions per week that landed in each bucket (committed lines, agent-attributed lines, drafts, files touched, PRs). Red-dashed weeks are low-N and noisy.</p>
    <div class="svg-holder">{{ buckets_svg | safe }}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="chart">
    <h2>Token cost per unit of work</h2>
    <p class="explainer">Tokens spent per PR, per committed line, per draft line, and per turn — computed weekly as sum(tokens) / sum(denominator), on a log scale. Weeks with no PRs or no git data drop out of the relevant line. Dashed reference lines show the SWE-chat opus-4-6 baseline.</p>
    <div class="svg-holder">{{ cost_ratios_svg | safe }}</div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p class="privacy">Everything runs locally. No upload, no telemetry.</p>
    <p class="caveat">{{ reference.label }} — tokens/PR ~{{ "{:,}".format(reference.tokens_per_pr|int) }}, tokens/committed line ~{{ reference.tokens_per_committed_line|int }}, median session output tokens ~{{ "{:,}".format(reference.median_session_output_tokens|int) }}, median agent committed lines ~{{ reference.median_agent_committed_lines|int }}, median turns ~{{ reference.median_turns_per_session|int }}. {{ reference.caveat }}</p>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
